<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - APPLIED EPS VIEW RAISED.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - APPLIED EPS VIEW RAISED.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>SoundView Financial Group said analyst Michael O'Brien raised his fiscal 1997 earnings estimates on Applied Materials Inc to $2.73 a share from $2.54 a share.</p>
<p>-- raised the fiscal 1998 estimate to $4.23 a share from $3.78 a share.</p>
<p>-- the rating remains unchanged at short, long-term buy.</p>
</text>
